        <figcaption class="mt-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-950">In your customer’s pocket</h3>
          <p class="mx-auto mt-2 max-w-xs text-sm text-gray-600">A link to a contractor’s own page: what they owe, their invoices, quotes and statements, and Pay with M-Pesa straight onto their account.</p>
          <%= learn_more.("The customer portal", "customer-portal") %>
